Subject: [PATCH 35/38] kebab: XNU-003 restore Restart / Power off menu actions

The config volume replaces UniXNU's built-in configuration, so the three
actions it ships with disappeared once unixnu.toml was loaded. The toml
now lists them explicitly:

    hello / Restart(reset) / Power off(shutdown) / Return to firmware(exit)

Config.c:1135-1147 accepts exactly reset, shutdown and exit.
